	abstract = {We consider the class of implicit--explicit general linear methods (IMEX). Such schemes are designed for ordinary differential equation systems with right hand side function splitted into stiff and non-stiff parts. We investigate error propagation of IMEX methods up to the terms of order p+2. In addition, we construct IMEX schemes of order p and stage order q=p, p≤4 and we verify the performance of methods in several numerical experiments.},
